cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or code, please cite the associated Data Descriptor."
title: "Length at maturity of Northeast Atlantic fish and elasmobranchs from ICES DATRAS surveys"
abstract: >-
  Length-at-maturity estimates (L25, L50, L75) for Northeast Atlantic teleost and
  elasmobranch species, derived from the ICES DATRAS bottom-trawl survey database.
  Estimates are provided at global, stock, area, and five-year-period levels, for
  combined sexes and by sex, with confidence intervals and model-fit metrics.
type: dataset
version: v1.0.0
date-released: "2026-07-20"
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/federico-maioli/length_at_maturity"
keywords:
  - length at maturity
  - L50
  - maturity ogive
  - DATRAS
  - ICES
  - bottom-trawl survey
  - fish
  - elasmobranchs
  - Northeast Atlantic
  - fisheries
authors:
